2, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc11i0c.jpg"}], "slug": "skeleseller", "storyline": "Your dream was to be an adventurer. You were out questing one day when you encountered a poisonous snake. You won the fight handily, but the poison started wearing you down. You headed to the nearest town, but with no antidote actually there for sale, you died.\n\nYou come back as a skeleton. You decide that your fate should never beset another adventurer. Unfortunately, with your adventuring career behind you, you need to recruit others to gather loot for you.", "summary": "Skeleseller is a laid-back idle game set in a vibrant fantasy world. You're a skeleton shopkeep who hires adventurers to collect loot for you after your untimely demise. Send adventurers into battle, sell what they find, and build up your town!", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/skeleseller", "videos": [{"id": 138362, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "3VjNu-fmwZ0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3VjNu-fmwZ0", "title": "Skeleseller trailer (upcoming indie game)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3VjNu-fmwZ0/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 173907, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "pLt7sdqPpFE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pLt7sdqPpFE", "title": "Skeleseller launch trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/pLt7sdqPpFE/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}